YHWH Ya' Way — v1.0.0  (first full release)
=================================================

The semantic-version line above (first non-blank line) is read by the build
scripts (dev/build_dmg.sh, dev/installer.iss, dev/build_appimage.sh) and by
dev/generate_appcast.py. Everything below is human-readable metadata.

Versioning (set 2026-06-07): pre-final releases were v0.0.x and v0.1.x; this is
the first full release, v1.0.0 (then v1.0.x patches, v1.1.x big updates, and
v2.0.0 a complete overhaul). The former "v1.0.0-beta.N" naming is RETIRED.

v1.0.0 is the first full release. It ships the four canon-shaped study editions
(each in five cover colours) of the complete 83-book library, with builds
targeted at five reading surfaces: everywhere/computer (Calibre, Thorium, ADE,
Nook), Apple Books (tablet), Kobo (e-ink kepub), Kindle (Send-to-Kindle), and
Google Play Books. Signed desktop applications are provided for Windows (Azure
Trusted Signing), macOS (notarized + stapled), and Linux (AppImage). It builds
on the completed build-pipeline deep-audit arc (rounds 8–16, byte-stable across
Windows/macOS/Linux) and the e-reader presentation overhaul first shipped in
v0.1.0. Live corpus/edition/test counts and the roadmap live in
dev/SESSION_STATE.md + dev/CHANGELOG.md (not this file).
